82236066928451_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HbkR1RdxpooQ7kNvwHkXy4S&_nc_oc=AdoAuXzfvuRc9z7nSO6m4Z-v96v0q_enCHm8vdQ-xi_8TcEd1NyvMzC3xDRh6LRBAiw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af31qKJu0qItL2ZyEV3gQvYZQzS4svF0JBUWNDHDdq8Glg&oe=69EA20FF"}, {"file_name": "FluentXR_Media Storage_Screenshot.png", "id": "3267266376829151", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974717_3267266380162484_3578961694161774596_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3TOpWMjxlsYQ7kNvwFJML7h&_nc_oc=AdpMNMZJmH93SyOHu9AOvl4s6Foq5L6gBrHbbwotLg0hi7d4N7L4a-FXK4kRkjsjY_w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0IZ425aiy4hC_olK3O75fb9-fc3ybe1P8HP34RQm-f_g&oe=69EA3A56"}, {"file_name": "FluentXR_Throw Pillow_Screenshot.png", "id": "3559508997603615", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_3559509000936948_3261126970408815056_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=syTYUvrZ3FUQ7kNvwHSxbuy&_nc_oc=AdqnqTeQAdDg6nW0Y-SeXSwUVC4UBE46he1_lkSjPliCRYKXe0Z9oWLzKxaYLocVSMY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2S9DaK_yQXNS82NAr09rza-52R06JJMvUcqrINrayh_w&oe=69EA313D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "FluentXR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unlock a personalized language learning journey through your mixed reality home. FluentXR transforms your space into an interactive learning environment.\n\nStep into a realm where learning is not just fun and effective, but also deeply personalized. FluentXR is not just another language learning app; it's your own private linguistics lab.\n\nTag real-world objects in your space with text and audio labels, making learning immersive and contextually relevant. Dive into our Word Shuffle mini-game to reinforce your skills and challenge yourself using the timer.\n\nCurrent Features:\nSpace: Living Room\nMain Language: English\nLearning: French / fran\u00e7ais\nMini-Game: Word Shuffle\n470+ available tags geared towards common living room objects such as \u201cCouch\u201d, \u201cTelevision\u201d, \u201cChess Set\u201d and \u201cGaming Console\u201d\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, continually expanding its selection of languages, locations, and mini-games. Achieve language mastery with FluentXR\u2014where your home becomes your classroom.\n\nNext Expansion: \nSpace: Kitchen\nSpace: Bedroom\nMain Language: French\nLearning Language: Spanish / espa\u00f1ol \nLearning Language: English\nMini-Game: Sentence Scramble", "short_description": "Transform your language learning experience. \n\nUtilizing mixed-reality passthrough technology turn your home into a dynamic classroom. Tag real-world objects in your living room with 470+ customizable tags for learning French. Sharpen your skills through the Word Shuffle mini-game.\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, updating with new languages, locations, and interactive mini-games. Dive into a context-rich home environment that's both captivating and practical."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Fluent XR Mobile Icon.png", "id": "2236631716529956", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_2236631719863289_7778467312643440417_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zvtwEam1E_EQ7kNvwESaIc4&_nc_oc=AdqnK9pPDuF0l3mc6GfDZT1Rbei4_beX-cnD7nrFDkezoTD3ZWNDlG7o-KfuoBlEsno&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3E32EGgmyRa20jVcOYFwNCT4cpzOwX6G7GWOOYhz0nug&oe=69EA2455"}, {"file_name": "Fluent XR PDP Art.png", "id": "2055286771488876", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974466_2055286774822209_4338361723960595313_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FqP1CVT3F7YQ7kNvwEVGceM&_nc_oc=Adqx2ztpR-bW_z6pqPjoUVfA5ywMckWBWoSqj19mC5SD5uhj-_YTBfpseR8jwukLmME&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af05ATKiJL